### 일정 생성 (Create Schedule)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/schedules?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "day": 1,
  "sequence": 1,
  "timeSlot": "MORNING"
}

### 특정 날짜의 일정 목록 조회 (Get Schedules of a Day)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/days/1/schedules?userId=1
Accept: application/json

### 단일 일정 상세 조회 (Get Schedule Detail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/schedules/1?userId=1
Accept: application/json

### 일정 수정 (Update Schedule)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/schedules/1?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": false
}

### 일정 순서 변경 (Reorder Schedule Sequence)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/days/1/schedules/reorder?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": 1,
  "oldSeq": 3,
  "newSeq": 1,
  "timeSlot": "AFTER_LUNCH"
}

### 일정 삭제 (Delete Schedule)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/trips/1/schedules/1?userId=1
